  "dslo:version": "0.8",
  "dct:title": "DSLO Mapping Layer v0.8 — Cross-Surface Mapping Geometry",
  "dct:identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.22180938",

  "dct:description": "The DSLO v0.8 Mapping Layer defines the lawful cross-surface mapping geometry used to align geometry, domain, invariant, and registry surfaces. Mapping surfaces remain deterministic, invariant-preserving, non-runtime, and non-agentic. This layer inherits exclusively from DSLO v0.7 substrate and manifold lineage.",

